        "paragraph_id": "3EEBFD64",
        "text": "with a similar expression for the y-direction. To prevent the generation of large shockwaves due to sudden changes of the bottom level, bottom updating due to avalanching has been limited to a maximum speed of vav,max (keyword: dzmax). Equation (2.107) shows the resulting bed level change within one time step."
      }
